  "question": {
    "text": "A rectangle \\(A B C D\\) has its side parallel to the line \\(y=2 x\\) and vertices \\(A, B, D\\) are on lines \\(y=1, x=1\\) and \\(x=-1\\) respectively. The coordinate of \\(C\\) can be",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1LpyI",
      "text": "\\((3,8)\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "McOCf",
      "text": "\\((-3,8)\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "aU17l",
      "text": "\\((-3,-1)\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ogEVM",
      "text": "None of these",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: Case I\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/7S15ruluWKJKf4q7gz0TVtzk4FWRmq9rlUJpaE6BJ6E.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nline \\(y=2 x\\ldots(1)\\)\n\\(A D\\) parallel to \\(y=2 x\\)\n\\(\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{AD}}=2 ~\\&~ \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{AB}}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\)\nfor \\(a=3\\)\n\\(A(3,1), B(1,2), C(-3,-6), D(-1,-7)\\)<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/SNGTmUw5DGV_rxGmmZ1zFxtWIdnL0AeToThWGu5cj2c.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\\(\\begin{aligned} & \\text { for } a=-3 \\\\ & C(3,3), A(-3,1), B(1,-1), D(-1,5)\\end{aligned}\\)<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/PtZaSYFJ2ZNQZ--gAKsKMdBc1tAkYbf9b6w2u5uovM0.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nCase II AD perpendicular to line (1)\n\\(\\Rightarrow M_{A D}=\\frac{1}{2}, M_{A B}=2 \\Rightarrow b=3-2 a \\Rightarrow d=\\frac{a+1}{2}\\)<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/ceJhDdZ9HLCuO8ldt5BLirocavCuA6WHKFv7XDYLN3Q.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nfor \\(a=3, C(-3,-2)\\)<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/lGF7kYE2pR3NQr2VLXxNRvqPMtzXkAbjscTUNbTWNV8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nfor \\(a=-3, C(3,7)\\)<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/SLzQYFuBUEUTTvLVWdKsGMUoyZ8vWdbJSGNC-dHkXaU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\\({ }^*\\) In both cases if abscissa of \\(C: 3\\) or -3\nthen co-ordinates of \\(C\\) can be \\((3,3)\\) or \\((3,7)\\) or \\((-3,-6)\\) or \\((-3,-2)\\)",
    "image": null
  },
